===Etymology===
From {{inh|en|enm|comparen}}, from {{der|en|fro|comparer}}, from {{der|en|la|comparare||to prepare, procure}}, from {{m|la|compar||like or equal to another}}, from {{m|la|com-}} + {{m|la|par||equal}}. Displaced native {{ncog|ang|metan}} (“to compare,” also “to measure”).

